        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwihīga kwa lūlīmi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we badūgū bane, lekagi ū kūkwīla ū mu nīmo gwa būlangi, managi gīkī ū nsango gwise a balangi gūkūbiza ntaale kūtinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bose tūkipamaga mu mihayo ya mbika na mbika; ūlū alīho munhū atipamaga mu kayombele, ū ng'wenūyo nshikanu; hangī ashikile kūgūlang'hana pyī ū mīlī gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manīlagi dūhū a ha gīkī tūkatungaga mu nomo gwa falasa tūlijamu tūdoololo twa kūjilyehya gīkī jitūlyehele; na ng'hana ī falasa na būtaale wajo tūkajitongeelaga mu gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hangī jiganikīlagi na meli, najo nhaale no; nīyo jikaselengetiagwa na miyaga mitaale. Alīyo jikagobagwa na kagobelo kadoololo, jatwalīīlwa ūko atogelilwe ū ngobi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo lūlī nū lūlīmi; ū loi lūlī kabudīka kado no, alīyo lūkihahambūlaga mihayo ya magaka mataale! Gwiganikīlagi hangī na moto, nago nūūlū gūkabiza ndo na ginehe, alīyo gūkabachaga mapoolu na mapoolu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo lūlī nū lūlīmi, nalo lūlī moto. Ū lūlīmi lwenūlo, ūlo tūtūūlīlilwe mu mīlī gwise, lokalile būkenaagūji. Lūkagūsosohajaga pyī ū mīlī, lwajikenaagūla ī nhūngwa pyī ī jose. Nose ū mīlī gwigeleelwa kūpemva mu moto ū gose, nū loi ū lūlīmi kūponyiwa mu nsango gwa moto! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno shiinū na shiinū ū mu sī jikasugagwa na banhū, hangī jamala kūsugwa, jibize noni, nūūlū ja kwigwesa ha sī, nūūlū ja mu nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū lūlīmi lo banhū atīho ūyo adūgije kūlūsuga, lūlī shikolo shabūbi īsho shitalembeelaga, hangī lokalile būsūngū wa kwenheleja icha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkalūtūmamīlaga kūnkumīlīja Mulungu Sīswe, alīyo hangī hū loi lwike tūkalūtūmamīlaga na kūzuma banhū, abo babeejiwe mu suso ya ng'wa Mulungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nomo gūmò gwenūyo dūhū īkafumaga mo mihayo ya kūkumīlīja na ya kūzuma! Badūgū bane, ī mihayo yenīyo ītigelile īje gīko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ū mu lwinzī ū lūmò gadūgije kūfuma mo minzī mapolo na malūlū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, ū ntini gūdūgije kūtwaja mizeituni, nūūlū ū nzabibu kūtwaja matwajo ga ntini? H'ūmo īlī nū lwinzī, ū lo minzī masalazu lūtūdūla kūfunya minzī mapolo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masala ga kūfuma kūlī Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū mu bing'we nani ūyo alī na masala na witegeleja? Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ni oolechage a masala gakwe mu shītwa sha widohya ū mu kashimīzīle kakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū mulī na wilu na wikolwa na wilwisha ū mu myoyo ying'we, yaya ū kwikumīlīja nūūlū kwībisa bisa ī ng'hana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A masala ayo galī gīko gatizile ū mu sī kūfuma kwigūlya, a genayo galī ga mu sī na kale; gafumile kūlī Shetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho būlīho wilu na wilwisha, a henaho nū wiyugagūji būlīho, pyī nī yīngī ī ya sagala sagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a masala ayo gafumile kwigūlya, ī soolo ya mhayo galī meela na hangī ga mhola. Galī na wiyūmīlīja, galī na wigwi, gokalile shigongo na matwajo masoga; a goi gatī na būsolanhya, galī ga ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī litwajo lya būtūngīlīja, īlo līkahambagwa na babeeja ba mhola, lyene mhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
